{# 4 of the row's 12 columns, 7 when the wall is on the denser grid - there it takes the room
   that Apdex and p95 occupy on a project that reports latency, so the name and the error count
   line up across every card. Both class names are written out so Tailwind can find them.
   The .sparkline class is what the stylesheet hooks onto to fix the library's mask stroke and
   to size the SVG - see app.css. #}
<div{{ attributes.defaults({
	class:'sparkline ' ~ (dense ? 'col-span-7' : 'col-span-4')
}) }}>
	{{ this.sparkLine|raw }}
</div>
